immigration, a 45-year-old Asian man is
found to have a positive tuberculin skin test
(TST). He denies cough, fever, soutum, or
weight loss. A complete physical examination
is normal. A chest X-ray is obtained that is
Shown in the following photograph. Which
one of the following is the next best step in
