 not show TB bacilli\nand is not used for diagnosing TB.\n\n(Option B) Bronchoscopy and lavage for\nobtaining samples are indicated if traditionally-\nobtained samples are negative but, based on\nclinical grounds, TB is a likely diagnosis.\n\n(Option D) High resolution CT scan of the chest\nhas no role in diagnosis of TB and is not\nindicated unless the diagnosis is not certain or\nother diagnoses than TB are considered..\n\n(Option E) Starting the patient on full-dose 4-\ndrug therapy for tuberculosis is indicated in this\npatient due to high possibility of TB as the\ndiagnosis, but it should be delayed until samples\nare taken because antibiotics, if used prior to\ntesting, may alter test results, mostly in for\n\nfaise negativity.\n\nobtained samples are negative but, based on\n\nclinical grounds, TB is a likely diagnosis.\n\n(Option D) High resolution CT scan of the chest\nhas no role in diagnosis of TB and is not\nindicated unless the diagnosis is not certain or\nother diagnoses than TB are considered...\n\n(Option E) Starting the patient on full-dose 4-\ndrug therapy for tuberculosis is indicated in this\npatient due to high possibility of TB as the\ndiagnosis, but it should be delayed until samples\nare taken because antibiotics, if used prior to\ntesting, may alter test results, mostly in form of\nfalse negativity.\n\nReference(s) ° RACGP - Tuberculosis testing\n\n¢ Australian Prescriber - Testing for\ntuberculosis\n\n- Therapeutic Guidelines - Antibiotic\nS: available from http://tg.org.au\n\nHide the correct option\nHide explanations\n\nFinish now Continue later","source_answer_status":"source_revealed","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"medium","currentness_keywords":[],"likely_visual_question":true,"parser_confidence":"very_high","parser_mode":"human_visual_review_batch009","text_method":"manual_visual_plus_context","parser_version":"manual-review-batch009-2026-09-24","visual_asset":null,"visual_source_page":42,"manual_review_batch":"009","manual_review_source_key":"","stem_hash":"0679095202b46ec97ad67ff3fabb0477fc3b412199c549fb6c91d05cbd7f7c8d"}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
