to Australia, presents with recent history of
productive cough and yellow sputum that is
sometimes associated with streaks of blood. He
has lost seven kg in the past three months. He
smokes 10 cigarettes a day. On examination, he
has normal vital signs. There are few small
painful nodules on his legs that are shown in the
following photograph. The rest of the
examination is inconclusive. Which one of the
