after he experienced an episode of vision loss
of his right eye lasting 30 minutes 24 hours ago.
The condition is resolved now. On examination,
the visual acuity of the left and right eyes are
6/60 and 6/36, respectively. A systolic murmur is
noted over the sternum. No carotid bruit is
heard. Which one of the following is most likely
to establish the cause of his condition?','{"A":"CT scan of the brain.","B":"Electroencephalography (EEG).","C":"MRI of the brain.","D":"Doppler ultrasound of carotid\narteries.","E":"Echocardiography."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 NEUROLOGY (1).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-b886c250d698","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"6309d1d21ebb21766679","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 NEUROLOGY (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 NEUROLOGY (1).pdf","source_page":24,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"five_block_inferred","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low','{"record_id":"6309d1d21ebb21766679","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 NEUROLOGY (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 NEUROLOGY (1).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":24,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Neurology","stem":"A 6/-year-old man presents for assessment\nafter he experienced an episode of vision loss\nof his right eye lasting 30 minutes 24 hours ago.\nThe condition is resolved now. On examination,\nthe visual acuity of the left and right eyes are\n6/60 and 6/36, respectively. A systolic murmur is\nnoted over the sternum. No carotid bruit is\nheard. Which one of the following is most likely\nto establish the cause of his condition?","options":{"A":"CT scan of the brain.","B":"Electroencephalography (EEG).","C":"MRI of the brain.","D":"Doppler ultrasound of carotid\narteries.","E":"Echocardiography."},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"low","currentness_keywords":[],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"medium","parser_mode